\item (2p) \textbf{Implementation (1p).} Implement constant-step $\epsilon$-greedy updates, as in Eq. (2.5) in \citet{sutton2020reinforcement}, as \texttt{nonstationary\_algorithm(Q1, bandit, epsilon, alpha)}. Return the same output structure as the greedy algorithm.
