\item (2p) Compare the two policies for MDP with $p_{\mathrm{high}} = p_{\mathrm{low}} = 0.9$ and $p_{\mathrm{high}} = p_{\mathrm{low}} = 0.4$ with $r_\text{wait} = 0.1 \text{ and } r_\text{search} = 1$. Run at least ten times per policy in each MDP and compute the mean reward. Which policy performs better in each MDP?
\end{enumerate}

